    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imisi itanu ishize, umuherezi mukuru Ananiya amanukana n’abakuru bamwe n’uwo kubavuganira yitwa Teritulo, barega Paulo ku cēgēra ca Kayisari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaze guhamagazwa, Teritulo atangura kumurega,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati Ni kubgawe igituma tugazagaza mu mahoro menshi, n’ibindi vyaroranirijwe ubu bgoko kubg’ imigabo yawe: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 23:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuko turavyemera uburyo bgose ahantu hose, Feliki umwubahwa, tugukengurukiye cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reka noye guhava nkurambira, ndakwinginze zirikana tuvuge amajambo make, kubg’ ubugwaneza bgawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 17:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twabonye uyu muntu ar’ ikīza, atera umugararizo Abayuda bose bari mu bihugu vyose; ni we remezo ry’igice c’Abanazareti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 21:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yagejeje no guhumanya urusengero, turamufata, [twāri tugomvye kumucira urubanza nk’ukw ivyagezwe vyacu bivuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ umukuru w’abagabisha b’abasoda Lusiya araza, amudushikura mu maboko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 23:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abarira abarezi biwe kuza imbere yawe.] Nawe ni wamwibariza ubgawe urashobora kumenya ivyo tumureze vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayuda na bo bafatanya na we mur’ ico kirego, bavuga kw ivyo ari ko biri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icēgēra ca Kayisari kimaze kumukebura ngw avuge, Paulo aramwishura,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati Ndazi k’umaze imyaka myinshi ur’ umucamanza w’ubu bgoko, ni co gitumye niregura ivyanje ndemye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 21:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuk’ ushobora kumenya yukw imisi itarasāga icumi n’ibiri, uhereye aho nadūgiye i Yerusalemu gusengerayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ntibāsanze mpārīra n’umuntu n’umwe, canke nkoraniriza abantu kubakikiza, naho hoba mu rusengero canke mu masinagogi canke mu gisagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ku vyo bandeze ubu, ntibashobora kuronka ikinyagiriza imbere yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.24.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 24:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw iki ni co nkwemerera: n’uk’ ukw iyo Nzira iri, iyo abo bita igice, ari ko nkorera Imana ya ba sogokuruza bacu, nemera vyose bifatanije n’ivyagezwe kandi vyanditswe mu vy’abāvugishwa n’Imana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.5.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 5:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.5.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mfise ivyizigiro ku Mana bimwe n’ivyo aba na bo biteze, yuko hazoba ukuzuka kw’abagororotsi n’abagabitanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 23:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma na ntaryo nkobereza kugira umutima utanyagiriza ikibi ku Mana canke ku bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 15:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ imyaka myinshi ishize, njanwayo no gushīra ubgoko bgacu ivy’ubuntu, no gutanga ibimazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 21:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkiri muri vyo bansanga mu rusengero nihumanuye, ata bantu nkoranije, ata n’uruhōgo ruriho. Ariko hār’ Abayuda bamwe bavuye muri Asiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni bo bāri bakwiye kuza hano imbere yawe no kundega, iyaba bafise ico bangaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Canke na bano na bo ni bavuge icaha bambonyeko, aho nari mpagaze imbere y’abanyekombe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 23:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shiti ryoba rya jambo rimwe navuze n’ijwi rirenga mpagaze muri bo, nt’ Ukuzuka kw’ abapfuye ni kwo kumpagaritse mur’ izi manza imbere yanyu uyu musi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
